WEBVTT

00:00:27.982 --> 00:00:31.611
But that's just not
how the immune system works.

00:00:31.611 --> 00:00:34.197
While the immune system can be suppressed

00:00:34.197 --> 00:00:35.865
and can be less effective --

00:00:35.907 --> 00:00:38.576
for example, in people
receiving chemotherapy --

00:00:38.576 --> 00:00:41.662
the reverse, strengthening
the system overall,

00:00:41.662 --> 00:00:42.997
just doesn't happen.

00:00:43.039 --> 00:00:45.166
Our immune system is what protects us

00:00:45.166 --> 00:00:48.503
from the bacteria,
viruses, fungi and toxins

00:00:48.544 --> 00:00:50.880
we encounter on a constant basis.

00:00:50.922 --> 00:00:54.133
It also plays an integral part
in wound healing.

00:00:54.175 --> 00:00:58.763
It’s an elegant network of cells,
tissues and organs,

00:00:58.805 --> 00:01:00.139
all working together.